{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_119_1000_026yur", "source_sha256": "e107d6735a0b19699caf5e304d4c8f7936d86706b31396084f34b2a438415443", "ja": "あはは、本を読んでて寝落ちは私もよくあるので……。\nでも、美希さんが夢中になれる本もきっとあります！", "zh": "啊哈哈，看书看着看着睡着这种事我也经常有……\n不过，肯定也会有能让美希前辈着迷的书的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_119_1001_026yur", "source_sha256": "d5bc421b94b0b6c0ff3bf8be8792ddf18cd91779200bc136f5c925d8bc1a9dc4", "ja": "今のイチオシはやっぱり、『星風の守護者』ですね！\n久しぶりに出た新刊も素晴らしかったので！", "zh": "现在最推荐的果然还是《星风的守护者》！\n因为时隔许久推出的新刊也非常精彩！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_119_1002_017kth", "source_sha256": "63ec21197655aee559014b972aaef8d711ada1a3d334e9e9a3fc11c8ac38ad18", "ja": "コラムで紹介してた、ファンタジー小説だね。\nでも、人気シリーズだから巻数もまあまあ……。", "zh": "这是你在专栏里介绍过的奇幻小说吧。不过，因为是热门系列，卷数也不少……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_119_1003_003mik", "source_sha256": "e8dcbfacf7a881d7d30f6b1a4a046062a521c25366bc97a64e08d0117b10f4d0", "ja": "えっ、長いの……？\nそれじゃあミキはパスかな～。", "zh": "咦，要读很久吗……？\n那美希就算了吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_119_1004_026yur", "source_sha256": "74a13276154bc46eed382dc7d58ea4ff8328af5c3a2a0ba5cfd241359151418a", "ja": "そ、そんなこと言わずに！　最初だけ、一巻だけ！\nそれでも十分に楽しめちゃいますから！", "zh": "别、别这么说嘛！先看一点，就看第一卷！\n即使这样也能充分享受其中的乐趣！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_119_1005_null", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_119_1006_p", "source_sha256": "a8d738964f727e3b3125bafcf3f5adea5912184e50c587338c6a4f68fdfa6614", "ja": "みんな、お疲れさま。\nなんだか盛り上がってるみたいだな。", "zh": "大家辛苦了。\n看起来挺热闹的嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_119_1007_026yur", "source_sha256": "f738a6d5c249a498e94c518e8ce754d84c9ca64d8b975dff5cb65246cab5048b", "ja": "はい！　名作『星風の守護者』を\n美希さんにオススメしていたところで……。", "zh": "是的！我正在向美希推荐名作《星风的守护者》……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_119_1008_p", "source_sha256": "b46389dd23c2acba01ea75c3cc8b11a55683deecad33f8e0342b3ca52933ecd6", "ja": "お、それはベストタイミングだ。メンバーも\n揃ったことだし、ちょっと仕事の話をさせてほしい。", "zh": "哦，时机正好。成员们也都到齐了，想和你们聊聊工作的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_119_1009_p", "source_sha256": "b637e6ad948a1798b8a0847c40cc0fba2df131643eb6366deb32df6fb350b788", "ja": "その『星風の守護者』なんだけど、\n今度、アニメーション映画になることが決定した。", "zh": "就是那个《星风守护者》，已经确定要改编成动画电影了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_119_1010_026yur", "source_sha256": "a0f1adb7995fdaa2e2b88fb721f8431b690661cead8535959e005fcb1e24e264", "ja": "っ！！", "zh": "……！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_119_1011_p", "source_sha256": "47cafe94ec3dfdb3d705e0f748d987b02c20acb8b7d8158593d518ef9c6aa523", "ja": "そして……その主題歌を百合子に\n歌ってほしいと打診があった。", "zh": "然后……有人来询问，希望由百合子来演唱那首主题歌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_119_1012_026yur", "source_sha256": "c2737d902faa865e069bb04eec9d501c2d10ac7716585782ea6a8b16fec3b6f0", "ja": "……っ！？", "zh": "……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_119_1013_p", "source_sha256": "f2d272f8b821623bea1078b2d45f47268488b87ab17b2aac36daab2157c0a61a", "ja": "監督が百合子のコラムを読んで、曲を聞いたそうだ。\nイメージにぴったりだという事で、打診があった。", "zh": "听说导演读了百合子的专栏，还听了那首歌。因为觉得和形象非常契合，所以来询问了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_119_1014_046rio", "source_sha256": "7c57a9b48e47ec54445b7488f2f9c1fba8819c60c0e816d15a61b80a784d5735", "ja": "映画の主題歌なんて……すごいわね、百合子ちゃん！\nもちろん、バックはお姉さんに任せてね♪", "zh": "电影主题曲啊……真了不起呢，百合子！\n当然，伴奏就交给姐姐我来吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_119_1015_048rei", "source_sha256": "9a0ad4148bd38bb345006871cd0b8f5f40b44a91a9dd4c028a596142bef749ea", "ja": "うんうん、私にも任せてほしいな♪\n……百合子ちゃん？　どうかしたの？", "zh": "嗯嗯，也交给我吧♪\n……百合子？怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_119_1016_026yur", "source_sha256": "92974c03112066b4dd95ca8af18dc3b737475a525c94539a0624c4de1bafb8be", "ja": "すっ……すみません……。\nあの、もう一回言ってもらっていいですか……？", "zh": "那……那个，对不起……  \n请问，能再说一遍吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_119_1017_p", "source_sha256": "6df6d068e5db1f4179dd415bfe06c2239ffe04da2ee8f2ce66be3b0180741867", "ja": "ええと……百合子の好きな小説『星風の守護者』が\n映画化する。その、主題歌を歌ってほしいそうだ。", "zh": "那个……百合子喜欢的小说《星风的守护者》要拍成电影了。他们想请你唱那部电影的主题曲。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_119_1018_026yur", "source_sha256": "deee91119408d35ef78bc83d6a54e99b93e4c3d87fe3616dc2bda6d4bc1be694", "ja": "っ！！　……聞き間違いじゃ、ない……。\nぐうっ……はあ、はあ……。", "zh": "！！……不是听错……。\n呜……哈、哈……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_119_1019_017kth", "source_sha256": "bb4f9ac9d6bb593ce5b1f46d0b321d6b00f014e093283702c90c4fa8c32be63a", "ja": "ゆ、百合子ちゃん、大丈夫？\nずいぶん苦しそうだけど……。", "zh": "百、百合子，你没事吧？\n看起来很难受的样子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_119_1020_003mik", "source_sha256": "28c7edacfdeca2c11e9c09c8a5c6ee9518b421e8cdac4388a831f302f03834de", "ja": "さっきまでその小説の話してたのに……。\n百合子、好きだったんじゃないの？", "zh": "刚才还在聊那部小说的事呢……\n百合子，你不是很喜欢吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_119_1021_026yur", "source_sha256": "3c6ae2dda3c01236675cc8c6e35bd4e2c06099e1fc5d8a742219690209d9d0b4", "ja": "だいっっすきです！！　老若男女が楽しめる、\n不朽の名作ファンタジーですから！", "zh": "最喜欢了！！因为这是老少皆宜的不朽奇幻名作！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_119_1022_026yur", "source_sha256": "6e8e7448b92bcae6ea138a44e908b9723cbb808a31540bcef496244ef7350eb5", "ja": "映画と言いましたね……まず、原作のどこを\n切り取るかが気になるところです……。", "zh": "您说是电影……首先，我很在意原作会截取哪个部分……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_119_1023_026yur", "source_sha256": "076cb92f2e2a44cf7b012fa0db144a5a99a7e5dd1a93044f8bf7d36faf9c84b8", "ja": "はっ、序盤の山場と言えば鏡のお城……！\nあれをどうやって映像にするんでしょうか……。", "zh": "啊，说到前期的高潮，就是镜之城……！\n要怎么把那个场景拍成影像呢……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_119_1024_026yur", "source_sha256": "e911e5719deedbe37bbd144780ead196a384a6c6605e91383c16d6abb0074f03", "ja": "ちょっと叙述的なギミックなんですよね～。\n読者の想像に任せるからこその良さがあって……♪", "zh": "这是个有点偏叙述性的机关呢～  \n正因为要交给读者去想象，才有它独特的魅力……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_119_1025_003mik", "source_sha256": "9f3270462c0e914b452442dda32474e0a20d276438c4c64bd6f4aaa1f9616328", "ja": "百合子……ひとりで苦しんだり、\n楽しそうにしゃべったり、忙しいの。", "zh": "百合子……一会儿独自苦恼，一会儿又兴致勃勃地说个不停，真是够忙的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_119_1026_046rio", "source_sha256": "25fc67a12456ae30b35d5eab26db1fa14f5a77289b827def384fd8439c095da7", "ja": "雑誌のコラムでも、熱く語ってたものね。\nこのわき目もふらない情熱、若さだわ～。", "zh": "杂志专栏里她也热情洋溢地讲过呢。这样目不旁骛的热情，真是青春啊～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_119_1027_p", "source_sha256": "6aff84f9a5fec79ef6853e023878657f4d160650cf2d28bf76c99e45479c1feb", "ja": "ああ、情熱は十分に伝わってきたよ……。\nそれじゃあ返事はOKってことで大丈夫かな？", "zh": "啊，那股热情确实充分传达到了……  \n那么，就当作答复是“OK”，可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_119_1028_026yur", "source_sha256": "4567325fa7f6390fae77e1c6c04707c14c52944a84129fa6e383562996319f32", "ja": "あ、いえっ……その……。\n……。", "zh": "啊，不是……那个……\n……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_119_1029_026yur", "source_sha256": "1db45ee1091f555e4e93901abf2eb9ad9a861572fdc5272911a4f2d79aaeda59", "ja": "す、すみません、考えさせてくださいっ！", "zh": "对、对不起，请让我考虑一下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_119_1030_003mik", "source_sha256": "9ce12e7df174cebe84ef39ec934df71051d5b77591931c71cf28c7aead2edad7", "ja": "えっ！？", "zh": "咦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_119_1031_017kth", "source_sha256": "9ce12e7df174cebe84ef39ec934df71051d5b77591931c71cf28c7aead2edad7", "ja": "えっ！？", "zh": "咦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_119_1032_046rio", "source_sha256": "9ce12e7df174cebe84ef39ec934df71051d5b77591931c71cf28c7aead2edad7", "ja": "えっ！？", "zh": "咦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_119_1033_048rei", "source_sha256": "9ce12e7df174cebe84ef39ec934df71051d5b77591931c71cf28c7aead2edad7", "ja": "えっ！？", "zh": "咦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_119_1034_048rei", "source_sha256": "474df888a0d6cd5e7f6566e8cc6fae1e82ec0600869c429d34fed169479553f5", "ja": "でもでも、百合子ちゃんの大好きな小説だよね？\nその映画化で、オファーを受けたんでしょ？", "zh": "可是可是，这是百合子最喜欢的小说吧？\n你就是因为它要拍成电影，才收到邀请的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_119_1035_026yur", "source_sha256": "2e8b48cac09d0fd3a654efda88646a41b5df089fd03f6514e7945126ecf6ec93", "ja": "はい、そうなんですけど……。その……。\n…………。", "zh": "是的，没错……那个……  \n…………", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_119_1036_017kth", "source_sha256": "9cec1c52ffb63aeb8874e0ec8f73a80cc860f3537ef43357d1e3a48bf0b0a82f", "ja": "もしかして……大好きな作品だからこそ、悩む、\nってことなのかな？　プレッシャーとか……。", "zh": "难道说……正因为是自己最喜欢的作品，所以才会烦恼吗？还有压力之类的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_119_1037_026yur", "source_sha256": "8821588d948f4b0144fd1f858b81ad31b7de88fb3576f405c9f703d65bdb3edf", "ja": "は、はい。\n恥ずかしながら、そのとおりでして……。", "zh": "是、是的。\n虽然有点不好意思，但确实如此……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_119_1038_003mik", "source_sha256": "72a422f1eaab69789e0bd11a730c0198b405fa2f1216c3a6f989a0e37a2e5249", "ja": "そっか。\nでも、返事はすぐじゃなくていいんでしょ？", "zh": "这样啊。\n不过，不用马上回复吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_119_1039_p", "source_sha256": "8b5057fa876dc20842696cef275643c908520f21abaa20e86e1c18d1e06788c5", "ja": "うん、まだ打診の段階だからな。\n百合子の考えがまとまるまでは、保留にしておくよ。", "zh": "嗯，现在还只是试探意向的阶段。\n在百合子整理好想法之前，我会先保留答复的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_119_1040_026yur", "source_sha256": "1a245757737fa368d4675cb3261a902cf75ad9c20af8b1f6842bb22e8379a52f", "ja": "す、すみません……。\nせっかくのお仕事なのに、ワガママを……。", "zh": "对、对不起……。\n明明是难得的工作机会，我却这么任性……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_119_1041_p", "source_sha256": "64315cddf31aef187057a9d80e2283b47394b4b8ea61409420816d9ff3003466", "ja": "慌てて結論を出すことでもないから大丈夫だ。\n落ち着いて、ゆっくり考えてみてくれ。", "zh": "这也不是需要急着下结论的事，没关系的。\n冷静下来，慢慢考虑一下吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_119_1042_046rio", "source_sha256": "0f573094f18aa9c39167c9f4c4403bb027fc8ac2cfc332119d22366e6269a36f", "ja": "もし悩んじゃうことがあれば、私たちに相談してね？\n話なら、いくらだって聞けるから！", "zh": "要是感到烦恼，尽管找我们商量哦？\n想找人倾诉的话，我们随时都在！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_119_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_119_1043_026yur", "source_sha256": "1e2a91f6fbf8f43f966ace841d751d7f88107a1ec4b7e14abd4d2ceafa9b9ca9", "ja": "はい、ありがとうございます。\n……。", "zh": "好的，谢谢你。\n……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
